<h2>How we're paid</h2>
<p>Our fee is a percentage of the claim payment, set in a TDI-approved contract and capped at 10% by Texas law. There's no upfront charge, and the first claim review is free. If you're not sure whether you need help, see <a href="/post/should-i-use-a-public-adjuster/">should I use a public adjuster?</a> or read more <a href="/about-us/">about our firm</a>.</p>
